 "distinguishes": "An Aztec-model private transfer from a shared contract, with one EIP-8250 nonce key per nullifier: transfers on disjoint nullifiers are pending together under disjoint-keys and one at a time under one; a double spend that shares one nullifier is refused while the first is pending and can never be valid after it is mined; the same nullifiers replace only at the bump; the first-use state gas caps fresh nullifiers at 5 under the EIP's budget and the key limit at 16 under any.",
